---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "My Town News — Local News for Your Town, Every Friday"
pageDesc: "Independent local news, built around the events, people and places that make a community. Free, every Friday."
---

{# The national homepage.

   Until 2026-09-12 this was San Francisco's front page with a national band
   bolted on top: the hero said "San Francisco", the nav said "All San
   Francisco", and below the map sat an SF-only Leaflet map and a list of
   fourteen SF editions. Launching a second city would have landed a reader in
   Waxahachie on a page about the Marina.

   San Francisco's map and edition list now live at /san-francisco/, which is
   to that city what this page is to the country. Every city's hub gets the
   same treatment as it grows past one edition. #}
{% set liveCities = cities | selectattr("live") | list %}

{# ── The national homepage, redesigned November 2026 ────────────────────────
   From a mock-up by a former IDEO creative director, keeping the site's navy
   and gold: one compact header, a banner, "find your edition" beside a
   "bring us to your town" card, the coverage map with its own text, and a
   single subscribe band. The per-city "Editor's Picks" cards were removed:
   a reader in Heber City has no use for a San Francisco lead story, and they
   were most of the page's height. #}

{# ── Header: the logo, the name and the navigation in one bar ───────────── #}
<header class="home-header" role="banner">
  <div class="container home-header__inner">
    <a class="home-brand" href="/" aria-label="My Town News home">
      <span class="home-brand__mark">{% inlineMark %}</span>
      <span class="home-brand__text">
        <span class="home-brand__name">My Town <em>News<sup class="tm" aria-label="trademark">™</sup></em></span>
        <span class="home-brand__tag">Free &amp; Independent · Every Friday</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav class="home-nav" aria-label="Site navigation">
      <a href="#editions">Editions</a>
      <a href="#where">Map</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a class="home-nav__subscribe" href="/subscribe/">Subscribe</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">

  {# ── Banner ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     The street is an original illustration (scripts/build-main-street.py),
     not a photograph: nothing to license, a few kilobytes, and drawn in the
     site's own colours. It fades into the navy behind the headline. #}
  <section class="home-banner" aria-labelledby="home-banner-title">
    <div class="home-banner__art" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container home-banner__inner">
      <h1 class="home-banner__title" id="home-banner-title">Your town. Your stories.<br>Your <em>community.</em></h1>
      <p class="home-banner__sub">Independent local news, built around the events, people and places that make a community.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── Find an edition, and bring one to your town ───────────────────── #}
  <section id="editions" class="home-find" aria-labelledby="find-heading">
    <div class="container home-find__inner">
      <div class="home-find__main">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">Explore our editions</p>
        <h2 class="home-find__title" id="find-heading">Find a community we cover</h2>
        <p class="home-find__sub">Enter your ZIP code to see if we cover your area, or browse our current editions below.</p>
        {% set zipVariant = "hero" %}
        {% include "partials/zip-lookup.njk" %}
        <p class="home-find__or" aria-hidden="true"><span>or</span></p>
        <a class="home-find__browse" href="#where">View all current editions <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>

      <aside class="home-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
        <svg class="home-cta__icon" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="128" cy="78" r="26"/><circle cx="58" cy="106" r="21"/><circle cx="198" cy="106" r="21"/><path d="M84 206v-26a44 44 0 0 1 88 0v26"/><path d="M22 206v-18a36 36 0 0 1 58-28"/><path d="M234 206v-18a36 36 0 0 0-58-28"/></g></svg>
        <h2 class="home-cta__title" id="cta-heading">Bring My Town News to your town</h2>
        <p class="home-cta__text">Interested in a local edition? We&rsquo;re always looking for new communities, local journalists and partners.</p>
        {# An email for now; a form later. #}
        <a class="home-cta__link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Bring%20My%20Town%20News%20to%20my%20town">Let&rsquo;s talk <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  {# ── Where we publish ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     The map is the navigation: live pins link to their city and show what
     they cover on hover or focus; "coming soon" towns come from
     comingSoon.json, never cities.json, so they cannot reach the footer, the
     subscribe page or the ZIP lookup, and they are not links.

     Drawn only once at least two cities are live: a map of the United States
     with one dot argues against the point it is making. No tile server and
     no third-party script: one cached SVG outline, recoloured green land on
     blue water in scripts/build-us-outline.js, with pins placed at build time
     by lib/us-projection.js. #}
  {% if liveCities | length > 1 %}
  <section id="where" class="home-where" aria-labelledby="where-heading">
    <div class="home-where__inner">
      <div class="home-where__text">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">Our current editions</p>
        <h2 class="home-where__title" id="where-heading">Where we&rsquo;re already local</h2>
        <p class="home-where__sub">We currently publish in a select number of communities, with more on the way.<span class="home-where__hint"> Hover over a town to see what it covers.</span></p>
        <ul class="home-where__legend" role="list">
          <li><span class="us-map__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Active edition</li>
          <li><span class="us-map__dot us-map__dot--soon" aria-hidden="true"></span> Coming soon</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="home-where__map">
      <div class="us-map">
        <img class="us-map__outline" src="/assets/img/us-outline.svg" alt="" width="1075" height="734" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        {% for city in liveCities %}
        {% set pt = city | usPoint %}
        {% if pt %}
        {% set eds = clusters | editionsInCity(city.slug) %}
        {% if eds | length > 1 %}{% set covers = eds | pluck("name") %}{% else %}{% set covers = eds[0].neighborhoods %}{% endif %}
        <a class="us-map__pin" href="{{ city.slug | cityPath }}"
           style="left:{{ pt.left | round(2) }}%;top:{{ pt.top | round(2) }}%"
           aria-label="{{ city.name }}, {{ city.state }}: {{ covers | join(', ') }}">
          <span class="us-map__dot"></span>
          <span class="us-map__label"><span class="us-map__name">{{ city.name }}</span><span class="us-map__state">{{ city.state }}</span></span>
          <span class="us-map__tip us-map__tip--{{ 'left' if pt.left < 22 else ('right' if pt.left > 78 else 'center') }}" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="us-map__tip-head">{{ eds | length }} edition{{ '' if eds | length == 1 else 's' }}</span>
            {{ covers | join(' · ') }}
          </span>
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
        {% for town in comingSoon %}
        {% set pt = town | usPoint %}
        {% if pt %}
        <span class="us-map__pin us-map__pin--soon" tabindex="0"
              style="left:{{ pt.left | round(2) }}%;top:{{ pt.top | round(2) }}%"
              aria-label="{{ town.name }}, {{ town.state }}: coming soon">
          <span class="us-map__dot"></span>
          <span class="us-map__label"><span class="us-map__name">{{ town.name }}</span><span class="us-map__state">{{ town.state }}</span></span>
          <span class="us-map__tip us-map__tip--{{ 'left' if pt.left < 22 else ('right' if pt.left > 78 else 'center') }}" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="us-map__tip-head">Coming soon</span>
            A weekly edition for {{ town.name }} is in the works.
          </span>
        </span>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {# ── Subscribe band ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Goes to /subscribe/, where a reader chooses editions: a national page
     has no single tag to apply, and an untagged signup would mail someone
     every edition in the country. #}
  <section id="newsletter" class="home-band" aria-labelledby="band-heading">
    <div class="container home-band__inner">
      <span class="home-band__icon">{% inlineMark %}</span>
      <h2 class="home-band__title" id="band-heading">Local news makes stronger communities.</h2>
      <div class="home-band__action">
        <a class="home-band__btn" href="/subscribe/">Subscribe <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        <p class="home-band__note">Free &amp; Independent · Every Friday</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
